<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id">- Engungwel</book>
  <para style="h">1 Piɛɛl</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ɔ̃nkaan wu ɛ̃kwel wa Piɛɛl</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Piɛɛl</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Pi</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ɔ̃nkaan wu ɛ̃kwel wa</para>
  <para style="mt">Piɛɛl</para>
  <para style="imt1">Obɛɛn b'ɔ̃nkaan</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔ̃swɛn ɔ̃nkaan wu eli Simɔ̃-Piɛɛl, ngɔmɔ̃ onse antam a Yeso (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1PE 1:1">1.1</ref></char>). Ndɛ abɛɛl ndiri ndɛ áli mwɛn a ãmpal ã Mãsia (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1PE 5:1">5.1</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Dzak ye Dzaã áli anga-ndoo a ndɛ b'ɔ̃tio. Yeso áyɛɛn tsɔɔn ndiri akieel abam ndɛ wu Piɛɛl me ndɔɔ a ndɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 21:18">Dzã 21.18</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔ̃nkaan a Piɛɛl wu ɛ̃kwel wu oli onge ɔ̃nkaan wu abedzuu m'ãmboo m'ãmboo, wu éswɛn ndɛ fa Babilon (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1PE 5:13">5.13</ref></char>). Ndɛ oyuɔɔl ndɛ ol'akiool b'alili (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1PE 2:2">2.2</ref></char>) bvool b'emfa bwɛn emfa b'ãbvɔɔn mã nsie yi Adzi b'atsi-tsiri, bɛn meba ŋã abeta me Tuuki. Onse ɔ̃nkaan wu, Piɛɛl ayɛɛn ãndɔɔ bibi m'ási ye m'áswɛn me lio li Ondoo bo tsɔɔn. M'emfa okyɛ, mbuul okoo k'atsam ndiri, baal b'ãbvɔɔn omɔ̃ áli Ayuda. Kɛn ŋ'emwɛn mbuul ãyɛɛn mã: «byɛ tsɔɔn k'éli baal a ndɛ wɛ...» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1PE 2:10">2.10</ref></char>), ndɛ ol'okwaal otsɛn ndiri baal bibi b'eyuɔɔl ndɛ ɔ̃nkaan k'áli Ayuda wɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Otsɛn b'ɔ̃nkaan wu bɔ ba:</para>
  <para style="io">Ntam Piɛɛl odzii k'awa akiool luo li asɛn ãnã ke nkwel ɛ̃mbio mi ɛ̃̀yeya. Ndɛ hɛ̃ odzii kwɛn baal akal y'epfuũ bvi ngesɛ me lio li ãmpal, onse ɔ̃kiri wu otaal wu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1PE 1:3-9">1.3-9</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:18-5:10">3.18–5.10</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io">Piɛɛl hɛ̃ ayɛɛn me ndɔɔ a kaã li nɛn me Nziã me lio li fool (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1PE 1:3-25">1.3-25</ref></char>) y'oyɛɛ bo ngwanyã bɛn wɛn Mfam oli ke ywel okwɛn bueel (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1PE 2:13-17">2.13-17</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io">Ndɛ asuo kwɛn ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ ãwuaal ankyal k'akal ye lweel li amfam a bɔ, onkyam ŋɛn bɔ ali abi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1PE 2:18-25">2.18-25</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io">Mɔ̃ hɛ̃ ãwuaal akal y'alam k'ayɛɛ emfa ki akal onse ãbal (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1PE 3:1-7">3.1-7</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io">Ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ bvool ãwuaal akiool k'adzii bakyɛ, onkyam ŋɛn bɔ asa obi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1PE 3:8-17">3.8-17</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">M'emfa okyɛ, Piɛɛl ata mboo a Yeso wɛn onkyam ŋɛn «ákeswel ndɛ ɛ̃tswɛ, ndɛ k'ákebveel ɛ̃tswɛ wɛ. Ŋ'áketuaal ndɛ mpal, ndɛ k'ákeŋaan mbuul wɛ, kɛn a ndɛ áwi mbueel me mviɔɔl ɛ̃ Nziã wu abetsiil ãndɔɔ m'emfa ki dzu» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1PE 2:23">2.23</ref></char>). Mboo oyɔ hɛ̃ eli y'obvɛn me bia-byɛ nonɔ̃.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1PE 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃bio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 1:1" />Mɛ̃ wu Piɛɛl, me ndi ntam a Yeso Mãsia. Mɛ̃ nkel byɛ b'ésueel Nziã ɔ̃nkaan, byɛ b'ebekal k'ɛ̃kiri mi onzii bvool etsɔɔn me nsie yi Ponte, yi Ngalati, yi Kapados, yi Adzi ye yi Bitini. <verse eid="1PE 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 1:2" />Nziã wu Taal ásueel byɛ ŋ'ɛ̃kwel onge b'éwɛɛ ndɛ, bvool ásuul byɛ me pyɛ me nkuul a Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal, me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ elweel Yeso Mãsia bvool kwɛn ãkel ã ndɛ ãsuul byɛ ekal ba ngel. Yɔɔl kwɛn Nziã asio byɛ nyiĩ, bvool awa byɛ opi bam ngamfɛn!<verse eid="1PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kaã li obvuul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 1:3" />Bia-byɛ elweel Nziã wu Tal a Mfam a bia-byɛ Yeso Mãsia! Ndɛ wɛn me nyiĩ a ndɛ, osi kwɛn aburu bia-byɛ li nsa yuaal, me nkuul a osiool o Yeso Mãsia onse b'ákwi-ákwi. M'emfa okyɛ, bia-byɛ ekal ye kaã li esa kwɛn bia-byɛ ekal y'elaã. <verse eid="1PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 1:4" />Obobɔ, bia-byɛ ebɔɔ ɔ̃swal wɛn k'akoo k'abii wɛ, k'ali ye mbiin wɛ, ompal o ndɛ hɛ̃ k'okoo k'ofa wɛ. Ɔ̃swal ondɛ, wu ékwee Nziã byɛ ke ywel. <verse eid="1PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 1:5" />Byɛ bɛn Nziã abekiaal me waan e ndɛ, me nkuul a okiool me ndɔɔ obvuul b'amaayɛɛl kwɛn bɔ omɔɔn me lio li ntɔ. <verse eid="1PE 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 1:6" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, byɛ eluul m'esɛ, onkyam ŋɛn ebvaan kwɛn me muaan lio, byɛ esam onse ãwua m'ɛ̃mbio mi emfa bwɛn emfa. <verse eid="1PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 1:7" />Ɛ̃mbio omyɛ̃, mi ɛ̃suo okɛɛn okiool o byɛ oli bɔ-a-bɔ wuo ke bɔ-a-bɔ wɛ. Ɔɔl mpii eluɔ ki ekieel ebii, kɛn eli onse mbaa k'atal okɛɛn lɔ eli li ebvɛ-ebvɛ. Emfa kiki, okiool o byɛ b'onduru ɔɔl m'ɔ̃bvɛn, abekie bɔ m'ãmpal m'emfa bwɛn emfa, me ndɔɔ yi atal okɛɛn bɔ omoowam. Obobɔ, ŋ'ekieel emɔɔn Yeso Mãsia, Nziã akieel awa byɛ lweel, akieel awa byɛ dzuun bvool akieel awa byɛ bvɛɛ. <verse eid="1PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 1:8" />Onkyam ŋɛn byɛ mwɛn-endɛɛl kɛn emwɛn Yeso wɛ, byɛ edzii ndɛ. Onkyam ŋɛn byɛ k'emwɛn ndɛ meba wɛ, byɛ elɔ okiool onse ndɛ. Obɔ otsɛn bɛn byɛ bam eluul m'esɛ. Esɛ okyɛ ki ye dzuun, bvool kyɛn mbuul k'akoo k'asuo kyɛ m'ãyɛɛn wɛ. <verse eid="1PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 1:9" />Esɛ okyɛ, byɛ ebɔɔ kyɛ me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ ebvuul. Okyɛ ebvakab ki ebɔɔ byɛ ŋ'ekiool byɛ Yeso.<verse eid="1PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 1:10" />Aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã áfaan-áfaan bvool ábwɛɛl ngesɛ obvuul obɔ. Bɔ tsɔɔn ŋ'ɛ̃kwel ámaayɛɛn me ndɔɔ a kab li éyɛɛl Nziã byɛ. <verse eid="1PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 1:11" />Bɔ ákesa mpɛn k'ayɛɛ ãlio y'emfa bvi eliĩ bvi éwi Ɔ̃fel a Mãsia. Ɔ̃fel ondɛ áli onse bɔ, bvool ákeliaal bɔ ŋ'ɛ̃kwel fool li ékeya Mãsia omwɛn, dzuun li ékebɔɔ ndɛ ke mbee oŋɔ̃. <verse eid="1PE 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 1:12" />Nziã áyɛɛl aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a ndɛ ndiri Nsia yi ékewa bɔ k'éli yi bam wɛ, kɛn a yɔ eli yi byɛ. Meba ŋã, b'atee byɛ Nsia yi Ngesɛ awi byɛ nsia a yɔ. Bɔ awi yɔ me waan li Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal wu áfi ywel. Bvool nsia oyɔ, ãnzwel mam ãdzii k'ãyɛɛ yɔ yam.<verse eid="1PE 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ãndɔɔ mɛn ebvaan akiool asa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 1:13" />Obobɔ, esuul ɔ̃fel a byɛ akal ngɔ-mwiĩ, ekal y'onkyab. Elɔ kaã e byɛ lueel onse nyiĩ yi akieel asio byɛ ŋ'ekieel emɔɔn Yeso Mãsia. <verse eid="1PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 1:14" />Onge baan ba ye lweel, ebee efua bvi éli a byɛ tsɔɔn me lio li éli byɛ kɛn onse odzɛɛn onɔɔn. <verse eid="1PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 1:15" />Kɛn emfa ngemɔ̃ kyɛn wu oti byɛ mbel oli ɔ̃nsensal, emfa kiki hɛ̃ ekal ɔ̃nsensal m'epfuũ e byɛ bvieel. <verse eid="1PE 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 1:16" />Obobɔ, Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã olieel bubu: «Ekal baal b'ɔ̃nsensal, ke ngwel wɛ mɛ̃ ndi ɔ̃nsensal.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:2">Lev 19.2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 1:17" />Onse ãbuɛɛn ã byɛ, wu ebeta byɛ me Taal wɛn, ɔ̃bɛɛ pyɛ, abetsiil ãndɔɔ ã mbuul bwɛn a mbuul m'emfa ki ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ ndɛ. Obobɔ, esuo m'emfa ki edzuu byɛ wɛn byɛ eli ye bvɛɛ e ndɛ. <verse eid="1PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 1:18" />Byɛ eyɛɛ bam wɛn, ásuun byɛ m'epfuũ e byɛ bvi ngwel-a-ngwel, bvi ésiil ankiɔɔn byɛ. Kɛn a k'ásuun byɛ m'eluɔ bvi ebebii wɛ, onge aadzã wuo ɔɔl. <verse eid="1PE 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 1:19" />Kɛn a ásuun byɛ m'ãkel ã Mãsia m'ɔ̃bvɛn, ndɛ wu oli onge muaan-emɛmɛɛ̃ kyɛn elyam pyɛ, ekel hɛ̃ pyɛ. <verse eid="1PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 1:20" />Nziã ásueel ndɛ ŋ'ɛ̃kwel ye k'abuo ɔ̃kiri, bvool me ndɔɔ a byɛ, ndɛ omɔɔn me lio li ntɔ. <verse eid="1PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 1:21" />Me nkuul a ndɛ, byɛ elɔ okiool onse Nziã, wu oseel ndɛ onse b'ákwi-ákwi bvool owi ndɛ lweel. Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, okiool ye kaã e byɛ eli me Nziã. <verse eid="1PE 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 1:22" />Ŋ'elweel byɛ otaa-taa, byɛ eyii tsɛtsɛ, me ndɔɔ yi edzii andoo a dzii m'otaa-taa. Obobɔ, edzii bakyɛ bam kokɔ m'ɔ̃kwal wa tsɛtsɛ. <verse eid="1PE 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 1:23" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Endɔɔ e Nziã esi kwɛn aburu byɛ li mburu yuaal. Endɔɔ olɔ k'eli onge ekwɛn ki ebekwa wɛ. Lɔ eli y'omwiĩ, lɔ k'ebekwa wɛ, lɔ eli li ãlio mbueel. <verse eid="1PE 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 1:24" />Ke ngwel wɛ ákel bubu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">«Mbuul ndyam wueel oli onge bviĩ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">bvool dzuun e ndɛ lueel eli onge efel e bviĩ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">Bviĩ ebekɛɛ bvool efel ebetswal.<verse eid="1PE 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 1:25" />Kɛn Endɔɔ e Mfam èkal ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:6-8">Edz 40.6-8</ref></char></note>.»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 1:25">Endɔɔ olɔ eli Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi átsal byɛ.<verse eid="1PE 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1PE 2" />
  <para style="s1">Okwel m'Endɔɔ e Nziã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 2:1" />Ebee ãbi m'emfa bwɛn emfa. Ebee mfya otsoo, ebee ye pfuru okal, ebee y'ɔ̃kwal-nsɔɔ okal, ebee hɛ̃ ye kwee okal. <verse eid="1PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 2:2" />Emfa ngemɔ̃ onge baan ba tiɛɛn-tiɛɛn, ekal y'efua ki kokɔ ki ãbiaal m'Endɔɔ e Nziã, ãbiaal m'ãywɛn ɔ̃mfee, kwɛn me mɔ̃, byɛ ekwel me ndɔɔ obvuul. <verse eid="1PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 2:3" />Ke ngwel wɛ, «byɛ embio, bu emwɛn kwɛn Mfam oli ngesɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:9">Ãnz 34.9</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="1PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 2:4" />Esyal tsotsoo a Mfam, ndɛ oli nkɔɔn yi omwiĩ yi éti baal pfɛɛ, kɛn a Nziã osueel yɔ bvool yɔ eli y'ɔ̃bvɛn ke mviil ã ndɛ. <verse eid="1PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 2:5" />Byam hɛ̃, onge ãnkɔɔn m'ãli m'omwiĩ, eyɔɔl kwɛn atuu byɛ me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ ekal nzɔ yi ɔ̃fel. Byɛ hɛ̃ ekal nkel a angaa-a-Nziã ba ngel, kwɛn byɛ ewa ãkab m'ɔ̃fel ola Nziã, ãkab m'ekiool ndɛ me nkuul a Yeso Mãsia. <verse eid="1PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 2:6" />Ke ngwel wɛ, etal m'áyɛɛn onse Ɔ̃kaan a Nziã:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">«Mɛ̃ nsuul nkɔɔn ngamɔ̃ yi nkiin ke Siɔ̃, yi ásueel bvool yi ɔ̃bvɛn.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">Mbuul wu ata kaã me yɔ kieel k'ayoo opfuru bam wɛ.» <verse eid="1PE 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 2:7" />Nkɔɔn oyɔ eli ye dzuun li bibi me ndɔɔ a byɛ b'akiool. Kɛn a me ndɔɔ a baal bɛn okiool pyɛ, ákel ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:7">«Yɔ eli nkɔɔn yɛn atuu áti yɔ pfɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:7">kɛn a yɔ eyii nkɔɔn yi nkiin, yi ɔ̃soo a nzɔ.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Ãnz 118.22</ref></char></note>»<verse eid="1PE 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 2:8" />Ke mboo yinkyɛ, áyɛɛn bvool ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:8">«Yɔ eli nkɔɔn yi abebɛɛl ãtsa me yɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:8">yi ebebal baal.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:14">Edz 8.14</ref></char></note>»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 2:8">Baal abebɛɛl ãtsa me yɔ, me ndɔɔ yɛn bɔ abebee k'akiool Endɔɔ e Nziã. Oyɔ hɛ̃ ndɔɔ yi áyɛɛl me ndɔɔ a bɔ. <verse eid="1PE 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 2:9" />Kɛn a byɛ, byɛ eli yam li ásueel, nkel yi angaa-a-Nziã b'Okwɛn, yam e baal ba ngel. Byɛ eli baal b'ésuun Nziã, kwɛn byɛ etsal nsia a ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ ndɛ mi ɛ̃nɛn. Ndɛ áti byɛ mbel kwɛn byɛ embal onse lempeel ebwel ke mwiĩ a ndɛ wu ɔ̃bvɛ-ɔ̃bvɛ. <verse eid="1PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 2:10" />Byɛ tsɔɔn k'éli baal a ndɛ wɛ, meba byɛ eyii baal a ndɛ. Ndɛ tsɔɔn k'ákesio byɛ nyiĩ wɛ, meba ndɛ oyii asio byɛ nyiĩ.<verse eid="1PE 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okal y'epfuũ bvi ngesɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 2:11" />Andoo a dzii, byɛ b'eli ɛ̃mbwel-nkuul bvool eli anzii me nsie, mɛ̃ nsɔɔ ola byɛ bubu: Ebee efua bvi ombuul bvi ebedzwaan onse byɛ onɔɔn. <verse eid="1PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 2:12" />Ekal y'epfuũ bvi ngesɛ onse baal bɛn k'ayɛɛ Nziã wɛ, m'emfa okyɛ, ke mboo yi ebekwee bɔ byɛ ndiri byɛ ebesa obi, bɔ amwɛn ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ byɛ mi ɛ̃bvɛ-ɛ̃bvɛ, bvool alweel Nziã me tsoo li èya ndɛ. <verse eid="1PE 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 2:13" />Ekal ye lweel li ambiri bueel, me ndɔɔ a Mfam. Ekal ye lweel li ɔ̃kwɛn, me ndɔɔ yɛn ndɛ oli mfam wa ke ywel a baal bueel. <verse eid="1PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 2:14" />Ekal hɛ̃ ye lweel li amfam ba ke nsɛn a ndɛ, b'eyuɔɔl ndɛ me ndɔɔ yi awa b'abesa ãbi etumbu bvool me ndɔɔ yi atuɛɛn b'abesa obvɛ. <verse eid="1PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 2:15" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ndɔɔ yi edzii Nziã yɛn, ŋ'esa byɛ obvɛ, byɛ ekuru ɛ̃nywã ɛ̃ baal b'ali onse odzɛɛn y'owool-a-wool. <verse eid="1PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 2:16" />Ekal onge baal ba ndii, kɛn ondii o byɛ obee okal onge eluɔ ki efoo obi. Ekal onge asal a Nziã. <verse eid="1PE 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 2:17" />Ekal ye bvɛɛ e mbuul wueel, edzii andoo onse okiool, ebal Nziã, elweel ɔ̃kwɛn.<verse eid="1PE 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Odzuu m'emfa ki édzuu Mãsia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 2:18" />Asal, ewa amfam a byɛ bvɛɛ li bibi, ke kɛn a b'ali ngesɛ bvool y'efyɛ wɛ, elweel abi hɛ̃. <verse eid="1PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 2:19" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ŋɛn byɛ emwɛn ãmpal m'ãndɔɔ mɛn byɛ ki esi pyɛ, byɛ ekuru ɔ̃kwal me ndɔɔ a Nziã, obobɔ eli ngesɛ. <verse eid="1PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 2:20" />Ke ngwel wɛ, dzuun li emã, ŋɛn abɛɛl byɛ me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ esi obi? Kɛn okɛɛn byɛ emwɛn fool ke mbee obvɛ b'esi byɛ bvool byɛ ekuru ɛ̃kwal, eli ndɔɔ yi ngesɛ ke mviil ã Nziã. <verse eid="1PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 2:21" />Oyɔ ndɔɔ yi áti byɛ mbel me ndɔɔ a yɔ, ke ngwel wɛ Mãsia ndyam hɛ̃ ámwɛn fool me ndɔɔ a byɛ, ndɛ osuo byɛ nkuul kwɛn byɛ eluɛɛn kuul e ndɛ. <verse eid="1PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 2:22" />Ndɛ k'ási obi wɛ, pfuru hɛ̃ k'épal onse ɔ̃nywã ndɛ wɛ. <verse eid="1PE 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 2:23" />Ŋ'ákeswel ndɛ ɛ̃tswɛ, ndɛ k'ákebveel ɛ̃tswɛ wɛ, ŋ'áketuaal ndɛ mpal, ndɛ k'ákeŋaan mbuul wɛ, kɛn a ndɛ áwi mbueel me mviɔɔl ɛ̃ Nziã wu abetsiil ãndɔɔ m'emfa ki dzu. <verse eid="1PE 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 2:24" />Ndɛ ndyam olaal ãbi ã bia-byɛ me nzuru a ndɛ nkal enkulusu, me ndɔɔ yɛn bia-byɛ ekwa m'obi bvool ekal y'omwiĩ me ndɔɔ ãndɔɔ mã dzu. Eli me nkuul a ãbwɔɔ ã ndɛ k'ebvuul byɛ. <verse eid="1PE 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 2:25" />Ke ngwel wɛ, byɛ éli onge emɛmɛɛ̃ bvi edziɔɔn, kɛn a meba byɛ eyebvool ol'Ɔ̃mbuaal y'Ɔ̃nkiaal a byɛ.<verse eid="1PE 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1PE 3" />
  <para style="s1">Akal bwɛn alam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 3:1" />Emfa kiki hɛ̃ byɛ b'akal, ewa alam a byɛ dzuun, m'emfa okyɛ onkyam ŋɛn baal bakyɛ onse bɔ k'akiool Endɔɔ e Nziã wɛ, bɔ akiool lɔ me ndɔɔ epfuũ e byɛ, ndɔɔ yi ayɛɛn bɔ pyɛ. <verse eid="1PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 3:2" />Ki nguo ki emwɛn bɔ epfuũ e byɛ bvi ebvɛ-ebvɛ bvool bvi ewa alam bvɛɛ. <verse eid="1PE 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 3:3" />Ompal o byɛ obee kɛn b'okwel-a-nzi okal, onge ofaal o mfu, olaal b'eluɔ bvi ãtswi bvi ɔɔl wuo ekɔ bvam bvi ebvɛ-ebvɛ. <verse eid="1PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 3:4" />Ompal b'ebii byɛ bvel-bvel okal b'onse ɔ̃kwal, ompal b'ɔ̃fel wu efyɛ ye wu opi b'onduru ɔ̃bvɛn ke mviil ã Nziã bvool bɛn k'ofa wɛ. <verse eid="1PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 3:5" />Emfa kiki, akaal ba ngel ba tsɔɔn, b'áli ye kaã me Nziã, áli y'ompal obɔ, me ndɔɔ yɛn bɔ ákewa alam a bɔ dzuun. <verse eid="1PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 3:6" />Emfa ngemɔ̃ onge Sala wu álweel Abalayam bvool áti ndɛ me «Mfam a mɛ̃.» Byɛ eyii baan a ndɛ b'akaal okɛɛn byɛ esa obvɛ, ki ebal pyɛ.<verse eid="1PE 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 3:7" />Emfa kiki, byɛ b'alam, efaal akal a byɛ onse ãbal. Eyɛɛ wɛn akaal ali y'okwal bibi. Ewal bɔ ye bvɛɛ, ke ngwel wɛ bɔ akieel ayɔɔ kab li elaã li taa-taa ola Nziã onge byɛ. Byɛ esa obobɔ, eluɔ si ngemɔ̃ k'èkii ãbuɛɛn a byɛ wɛ.<verse eid="1PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Luo me ndɔɔ osa b'obvɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 3:8" />Obobɔ, byɛ bam bueel ekal ãtsam ngãmɔ̃, esa bakyɛ obvɛ, edzii bakyɛ me dzii li baan a Nziã, ekal ye nyiĩ a bakyɛ, ekal hɛ̃ y'okuaal o nzuru. <verse eid="1PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 3:9" />Ebee obi m'obi obveel, ebee ɛ̃tswɛ hɛ̃ m'ɛ̃tswɛ obveel. Ebveel m'ondɔɔl o kuɔɔl, nzal-a-ŋɛn Nziã ŋ'áti byɛ mbel, me ndɔɔ obobɔ, kwɛn byɛ ewal ɔ̃swal wu ondɔɔl o kuɔɔl. <verse eid="1PE 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 3:10" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Ɔ̃nkaan wa ngel ayɛɛn bubu: «Mbuul wu odzii k'akal y'omwiĩ bo ngesɛ bvool akal y'ãtsoo m'esɛ, ebvaan ndɛ abee k'ayɛɛn obi me bakyɛ bvool abee ãndɔɔ mã pfuru oyɛɛn. <verse eid="1PE 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 3:11" />Ebvaan ndɛ abal ãbi, asa obvɛ bvool abii opi y'ɔ̃tɛɛ̃ wueel. <verse eid="1PE 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 3:12" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mviil ã Mfam ãli nkal a baal b'ali dzu bvool abeyoo ãbuɛɛn ã bɔ, kɛn a ndɛ abetiɔ b'abesa obi eboo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:13-17">Ãnz 34.13-17</ref></char></note>»<verse eid="1PE 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 3:13" />Okɛɛn byɛ edzii bam k'esa obvɛ, wu asa byɛ obi nã? <verse eid="1PE 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 3:14" />Onkyam ŋɛn byɛ emwɛn fool me ndɔɔ obvɛ b'esa byɛ, byɛ eli baal b'esɛ! Ebee ye buɔ o baal okal bvool ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ byɛ ɛ̃bee ke ywel okal. <verse eid="1PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 3:15" />Kɛn onse ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ byɛ, ekal ye lweel e Mãsia wu oli Mfam a byɛ. Ekal ãlio mbueel onse ɔ̃yɛɛl wu ebveel ɛ̃mfuul ɛ̃ baal b'afuul byɛ otsɛn b'eli byɛ ye kaã. <verse eid="1PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 3:16" />Kɛn a byɛ esa ndɔɔ oyɔ y'efyɛ bvool ye bvɛɛ. Ekal y'ãtsam mã ngesɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn b'akwee byɛ me ndɔɔ epfuũ e byɛ bvi ngesɛ onse Mãsia, abɔɔ opfuru. <verse eid="1PE 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 3:17" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ngesɛ mbuul amwɛn fool ŋ'esa ndɛ obvɛ okɛɛn Nziã odzii obobɔ, ye k'amwɛn fool m'osa b'obi. <verse eid="1PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 3:18" />Nzal-a-ŋɛn, Mãsia ndyam hɛ̃ ámwɛn fool sa ngelemɔ̃ ɔ̃bu me ndɔɔ ãbi ã baal. Ndɛ wa dzu, ákwi me ndɔɔ a baal b'ãbi, me ndɔɔ yi abiri bɔ ola Nziã. Ndɛ ákwi m'ombuul, kɛn a ndɛ ásiool m'Ɔ̃fel. <verse eid="1PE 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 3:19" />M'Ɔ̃fel ondɛ, ndɛ oyetsal Nsia yi Ngesɛ ol'ɛ̃fel mi me bwal. <verse eid="1PE 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 3:20" />Ɛ̃fel omyɛ̃ tsɔɔn ɛ̃́bee Nziã olweel me lio li ékesuo ndɛ osɛ-mwiĩ o ndɛ, ŋ'éketuu Nowa ãsua. Ɔ̃bvɛn a baal atsi-tsiri, bɔ mpuɔ̃, ásam onse ãsua bvool ábvuul m'ãdza. <verse eid="1PE 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 3:21" />Eli emfa ngemɔ̃ onge opongo b'obvuul byɛ meba. Otsɛn b'opongo k'oli ombaal o mbiin e nzuru wɛ, kɛn a bɔ oli owa b'ɔ̃kwal ola Nziã m'okal y'ãtsam mã ngesɛ. Bɔ obvuul byɛ m'osiool o Mãsia. <verse eid="1PE 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 3:22" />Ndɛ oyɛn ywel bvool oli me kuɔɔl e Nziã ki elam. Meba, ãnzwel y'ɛ̃fel mi y'omfam ye mi ye waan ɛ̃li ke nsɛn okwɛn o ndɛ.<verse eid="1PE 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1PE 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 4:1" />M'emfa okyɛ, onge bɛn Mãsia ámwɛn fool onse nzuru a ndɛ, byɛ hɛ̃, ekal y'ɔ̃yɛɛl wu emwɛn fool onge ndɛ, ke ngwel wɛ mbuul wu omwɛn fool onse nzuru a ndɛ, ŋ'aman y'ãbi. <verse eid="1PE 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 4:2" />Bɛɛn meba, me lio li esiil li omwiĩ o byɛ me nsie, ekal m'emfa ki edzii Nziã, ke m'emfa ki efua e byɛ bvi ombuul wɛ. <verse eid="1PE 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 4:3" />Ke ngwel wɛ, m'ãlio m'ã́bwel, byɛ bam ési ãndɔɔ m'edzii baal bɛn k'ayɛɛ Nziã wɛ, ŋ'ékekal byɛ onse ãndɔɔ m'esio, onse efua bvi ebi-ebi, onse obɔɔ o mbal, onse odza b'onduru ɔ̃ndel, onse onywã b'onduru ɔ̃ndel, bvool onse obuɛɛn b'anziã ba mfya b'oli ndɔɔ yi áluo. <verse eid="1PE 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 4:4" />Obobɔ, baal bɛn k'ayɛɛ Nziã wɛ akam me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ k'ebedzuu nkuul mɔ̃ ye bɔ onse ãndɔɔ m'esio wɛ, bɔ bu abvi byɛ okwee. <verse eid="1PE 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 4:5" />Kɛn a bɔ akieel ayɛɛn m'ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ bɔ ola Nziã wu amaawal ɔ̃yɛɛl wu atsiil ãndɔɔ ã baal b'amwiĩ-mwiĩ ye mã b'ámaakwa. <verse eid="1PE 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 4:6" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn ál'atsal Nsia yi Ngesɛ hɛ̃ ola baal bɛn ŋ'eyɛɛn ŋã amaakwa. M'emfa okyɛ, ke mbee a ŋ'ebɔɔ bɔ etumbu onge ki ebebɔɔ baal bueel m'emfa ki ombuul, bɔ akal y'elaã m'ɔ̃fel, m'emfa ki Nziã.<verse eid="1PE 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbuul bwɛn a mbuul ye kab e ndɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 4:7" />Ntɔ a eluɔ bvieel eyii tsotsoo. Oŋɔ̃ ekal y'ãyal bvool y'onkyab, kwɛn byɛ ekoo k'ebuɛɛn. <verse eid="1PE 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 4:8" />Ke nkwel a mbueel, edzii bakyɛ bam bibi, ke ngwel wɛ dzii efoo ɔ̃bɔbɔ wu ãbi. <verse eid="1PE 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 4:9" />Eyɔɔ bakyɛ, ebee obwɔɔl. <verse eid="1PE 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 4:10" />Ngɔmɔ̃ ngɔmɔ̃ onse byɛ oyɔɔ kab me nyiĩ a Nziã. Oŋɔ̃ ewuaal a bakyɛ me lɔ. M'emfa okyɛ, byɛ ekal asal ba ngesɛ b'atal ãkab ã Nziã m'emfa bwɛn emfa. <verse eid="1PE 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 4:11" />Yɔɔl kwɛn mbuul wu ayɛɛn, ayɛɛn ãndɔɔ m'ãfa ola Nziã. Wu asa ɔ̃sal, asa ndɛ me mpɛn yi ewa Nziã. M'emfa okyɛ, m'ãndɔɔ mbueel, baal bueel awa Nziã dzuun me Yeso Mãsia, ndɛ wɛn lweel ye waan eli li ndɛ ɔ̃bu nzal ɔ̃bu. Amɛn!<verse eid="1PE 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Esɛ onse ãmpal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 4:12" />Andoo a dzii, mbaa yi ɛ̃mbio yi alɔ byɛ onse yɔ, ebee yɔ owal onge ndɔɔ yi ɛ̃kam, olɔ yɛɛn wɛn ndɔɔ yi ɛ̃kam eyi me byɛ. <verse eid="1PE 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 4:13" />Kɛn ekal y'esɛ me ndɔɔ yi esam byɛ onse ãmpal ã Mãsia. M'emfa okyɛ, ŋ'ekieel emɔɔn lweel e ndɛ, byɛ hɛ̃ ekieel eluul m'esɛ. <verse eid="1PE 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 4:14" />Okɛɛn atoo byɛ me nkuũ a Mãsia, byɛ eli baal b'esɛ. Ɔ̃fel wu omfam, Ɔ̃fel a Nziã oli nkal a byɛ. <verse eid="1PE 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 4:15" />Kɛn a yɔɔl kwɛn mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ onse byɛ, ŋ'emwɛn ndɛ fool, abee lɔ omwɛn me ndɔɔ yɛn ndɛ oli ɔ̃bam a baal, wuo oli mbuul a pfuul, wuo abesa obi, wuo me ndɔɔ yɛn ndɛ abesam onse anga-ãndɔɔ. <verse eid="1PE 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 4:16" />Kɛn okɛɛn ndɛ amwɛn fool me ndɔɔ yɛn ndɛ oli ɔ̃kilisito, yɔɔl kwɛn ndɛ abee opfuru oyoo me ndɔɔ oyɔ. Kɛn a yɔɔl kwɛn ndɛ alweel Nziã me ndɔɔ a nkuun oyɔ. <verse eid="1PE 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 4:17" />Ke ngwel wɛ, lio li etsiil Nziã ãndɔɔ ã baal emeekoo, lɔ ebɛɛn me Nzɔ a Nziã. Okɛɛn abɛɛn me bia-byɛ, ke b'abee k'alweel Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi Nziã, kieel bwɛn ayesɛn? <verse eid="1PE 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 4:18" />«Bvool okɛɛn mbuul wa dzu obvuul ye fool lam, k'abi y'anga-ãbi kieel bwɛn akal?»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 11:31">Ãmb 11.31</ref></char></note><verse eid="1PE 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 4:19" />Obobɔ, b'amwɛn fool me ndɔɔ yɛn Nziã odzii obobɔ, yɔɔl kwɛn bɔ awa omwiĩ o bɔ me mviɔɔl ɛ̃ ndɛ wu ábuo bɔ, wɛn k'akwɛɛn k'asa b'élieel ndɛ ndiri asa wɛ. Yɔɔl kwɛn bɔ asa obvɛ kɛn osa.<verse eid="1PE 4:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1PE 5" />
  <para style="s1">Akuul-kuul y'ãnsam onse Ebvɔɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 5:1" />Meba ŋã, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn y'akuul-kuul b'Ebvɔɔn onse byɛ. Mɛ̃ hɛ̃ ndi ɔ̃kuul a Ebvɔɔn onge bɔ, mɛ̃ émwɛn k'ékemwɛn Mãsia ãmpal bvool ndi ye boo li mɛ̃ onse lweel li èyemɔɔn. <verse eid="1PE 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 5:2" />Ekal ankiaal a nkel a emɛmɛɛ̃ e Nziã bvi eli onse byɛ. Ekyab me ndɔɔ a bvɛ. Oyɔ ebee ndɔɔ yi aywɛɛn byɛ m'oywɛɛn okal, kɛn a byɛ esa ɔ̃sal a byɛ m'ɔ̃kwal ngɔmɔ̃ m'emfa ki edzii Nziã. Ebee obobɔ osa me ndɔɔ a pfuul o nzi, esa me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ edzii bam k'ewuaal a emɛmɛɛ̃ obvɛ. <verse eid="1PE 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 5:3" />Ebee baal b'awi byɛ okiaal onyam m'onyam, kɛn a byɛ ekal baal bɛn bɔ aluɛɛn a kuul e bɔ. <verse eid="1PE 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 5:4" />Obobɔ, ŋ'ekieel epal mfam a ankiaal b'emɛmɛɛ̃, byɛ ekieel ebɔɔ ekɔrɔ ki omfam kyɛn ompal k'ofa bam wɛ.<verse eid="1PE 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 5:5" />Emfa kiki hɛ̃, byɛ b'ãnsam, elweel akuul-kuul b'Ebvɔɔn. Byɛ bueel, ekal y'okuaal o nzuru ye bakyɛ, ke ngwel wɛ ákel bubu: «Nziã abekii ɛ̃yɛɛl ɛ̃ baal b'ali y'ondɛɛl o nzuru, kɛn a ndɛ abesio b'ali y'okuaal o nzuru nyiĩ.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:34">Ãmb 3.34</ref></char></note>» <verse eid="1PE 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 5:6" />Oŋɔ̃ ekuaal ãnzuru ã byɛ ke nsɛn a kuɔɔl e Nziã ki waan, kwɛn ndɛ andɛɛl byɛ me lio li éyɛɛl ndɛ. <verse eid="1PE 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 5:7" />Etuul ãndɔɔ mbueel m'ebekɛɛ byɛ nguo nkal a ndɛ, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ wu abekiaal byɛ.<verse eid="1PE 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 5:8" />Ekal y'onkyab, ekal angɔ-mwiĩ! Ɔ̃taal a byɛ wu ɔ̃pfu afa ku abwel ku onge ebob ki eta ɛ̃baan m'obii o wu ekɔɔl kyɛ m'okɔɔl. <verse eid="1PE 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 5:9" />Esɛn ãna ke nkwel a ndɛ bvool ekal ye mpɛn onse okiool. Byɛ eyɛɛ wɛn baan-ngoo a byɛ b'atsɔɔn m'ɔ̃kiri wueel abebwel onse ãmpal m'emfa kiki hɛ̃. <verse eid="1PE 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 5:10" />Kɛn a ke mbee ŋ'ebwel byɛ onse ãmpal me muaan-lio, Nziã wu nga-nyiĩ yueel, wɛn me Yeso Mãsia, oti byɛ mbel onse lweel e ndɛ li ɔ̃bu, ndyam àsuul byɛ baal b'ɔ̃koo, àwɛɛl byɛ bvool àsuul byɛ baal bɛn k'atsiɔ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="1PE 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 5:11" />Lweel eli li ndɛ ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu! Amɛn!<verse eid="1PE 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃lɛɛl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 5:12" />Silas<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bakyɛ ati Silas me Silivɛ̃.</char></note> wu ebewal mɛ̃ onge ndoo wa taa-taa, owueel mɛ̃ m'oswɛn o byɛ ɔ̃nkaan wu m'ãmbel ke kwɛ. Mɛ̃ nswɛn ndɛ me ndɔɔ yi ewɛɛl byɛ bvool me ndɔɔ yi esuo byɛ wɛn, byɛ etɛɛn onse nyiĩ a Nziã yi taa-taa. <verse eid="1PE 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 5:13" />Bvɔɔn li Babilon ebio byɛ, lɔ li ésueel Nziã onge byɛ. Maak wu muaan a mɛ̃ hɛ̃ obio byɛ. <verse eid="1PE 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 5:14" />Ebio bakyɛ m'ɔ̃bio wa dzii li onziã. Opi okal ye byɛ bueel b'eli onse Mãsia!<verse eid="1PE 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 5" />
</usx>